<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Tenaga year net down 36 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Tenaga year net down 36 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Aug 31</p>
<p>		   (In million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)    25.9	vs	 40.7</p>
<p>    Net profit	     797.8	vs    1,243.0</p>
<p>    Turnover	     8,145.5	vs    6,855.3</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit     1,163.7	vs    1,636.0</p>
<p>    Minorities     less    5.4	vs less  10.3</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)    12.0	vs	 12.0</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Tenaga Nasional Bhd, a state-controlled power utility.</p>
</text>
